              "html": "<p>Ре­ши­те не­ра­вен­ство  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{3}{(2^{2-x^{2}}-1)^{2}}-\\frac{4}{2^{2-x^{2}}-1}+1\\ge 0\"></span>. </p>",
