              "type": "pipeline",
              "stage": "deterministic_svg"
            },
            "value": {
              "html": "<p>Пусть  <span data-inline-latex=\"y=2^{2-x^{2}}-1\"></span>, тогда </p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{3}{y^{2}}-\\frac{4}{y}+1\\ge 0\"></span>. </p></center><p>Введём за­ме­ну <span data-inline-latex=\"t=\\frac{1}{y}\"></span> ,  решим квад­рат­ное не­ра­вен­ство:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"3t^{2}-4t+1\\ge 0\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}t\\le \\frac{1}{3}\\\\t\\ge 1\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> . </p></center><p>Вернёмся к пе­ре­мен­ной <span data-inline-latex=\"y\"></span>:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\left[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{y}\\le \\frac{1}{3}\\\\\\frac{1}{y}\\ge 1\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3-y}{3y}\\le 0\\\\\\frac{1-y}{y}\\ge 0\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}y\\lt 0\\\\y\\ge 3\\\\0\\lt y\\le 1\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> . </p></center><p>Вернёмся к ис­ход­ной пе­ре­мен­ной:</p><center><p><span><span data-inline-latex=\"\\left[\\begin{aligned}2^{2-x^2}-1&amp;&lt;0,\\\\2^{2-x^2}-1&amp;\\ge 3,\\\\0&amp;&lt;2^{2-x^2}-1\\le 1\\end{aligned}\\right.\\Leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}2^{2-x^2}&amp;&lt;1,\\\\2^{2-x^2}&amp;\\ge 4,\\\\1&amp;&lt;2^{2-x^2}\\le 2\\end{aligned}\\right.\\underset{2&gt;1}{\\Leftrightarrow}\\left[\\begin{aligned}2-x^2&amp;&lt;0,\\\\2-x^2&amp;\\ge 2,\\\\0&amp;&lt;2-x^2\\le 1\\end{aligned}\\right.\\underset{2&gt;1}{\\Leftrightarrow}\\left[\\begin{aligned}x^2&amp;&gt;2,\\\\x^2&amp;\\le 0,\\\\1&amp;\\le x^2&lt;2\\end{aligned}\\right.\\Leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}x&amp;&lt; -\\sqrt{2},\\\\x&amp;&gt;\\sqrt{2},\\\\x&amp;=0,\\\\1&amp;\\le x&lt;\\sqrt{2},\\\\-\\sqrt{2}&amp;&lt;x\\le -1.\n\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span></span></p></center>",
              "title": "Решение",
              "asset_keys": []
            },
            "operation": "rewrite",
            "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
          },
